    "tagid": "MYSB93TC7",
    "message": "[CENTER][ATTACH]1042582[\/ATTACH]\n\n[B][SIZE=6]Carbonworks F4\n[\/SIZE][\/B]\n[SIZE=4]Based off of real-life Formula 4 cars, this single-seater is built with accessibility in mind. This makes it one of the most popular racing series in the world, and is generally the second step on the ladder to F1 after karting.\n\n[HR][\/HR]\nPowered by a 180hp Inline 4, and with a dry weight of 580kg, this thing is a blast to drive even with the limited amounts of downforce it generates. This is the perfect car if you're looking for close racing and beginner-friendly handling.\n[\/SIZE]\n[ATTACH]1042583[\/ATTACH] [ATTACH]1042588[\/ATTACH] [ATTACH]1042589[\/ATTACH]\n\n[HR][\/HR]\nDesigned from the ground up to be as detailed as possible, it also features a fully-accurate drivetrain, detailed and animated mechanical parts, as well as fully-adjustable aero.\n\n[ATTACH]1042585[\/ATTACH] [ATTACH]1042586[\/ATTACH] [ATTACH]1042587[\/ATTACH][ATTACH]1042591[\/ATTACH] [ATTACH]1042590[\/ATTACH]\n\n[HR][\/HR]\nThe Jbeam was also fully scratch-made with realism and close racing in mind. Everything has collisions, even the wheels and suspension. Say goodbye to wheels phasing through the car and through each other.\n\n[ATTACH]1042593[\/ATTACH] [ATTACH]1042592[\/ATTACH]\n\n[HR][\/HR][\/CENTER]\n[B][SIZE=5]Features :\n[\/SIZE][\/B]\n[SIZE=4]- Pit limiter and \"on-the-fly\" adjustable brake bias :\n[MEDIA=streamable]993s16[\/MEDIA]\n[\/SIZE]\n[LEFT][SIZE=4]- 10 detailed skins, an unpainted, raw carbon-fiber variant, and a single-coloured variant. Skin UVs are included in the mod files for skin-makers.\n[ATTACH]1046512[\/ATTACH]  [ATTACH]1042595[\/ATTACH] [ATTACH]1042596[\/ATTACH][\/SIZE][\/LEFT]\n[SIZE=4] \n\n- Black and Silver wheels\n[ATTACH]1046508[\/ATTACH] [ATTACH]1046509[\/ATTACH] \n\n- 2 different tire compounds : slick and rain\n[ATTACH]1046511[\/ATTACH] [ATTACH]1046510[\/ATTACH] \n\n[HR][\/HR][\/SIZE]\n[SIZE=5][B][B][SIZE=5]Credits:[\/SIZE][\/B][\/B]\n\n[SIZE=4][USER=355924]@TrackpadUser[\/USER] - Animated pushrod suspension idea, Racetec screen base[\/SIZE][\/SIZE]\n[SIZE=5][SIZE=4][USER=352746]@DaddelZeit[\/USER] - Brake bias LUA help[\/SIZE][\/SIZE]\n[SIZE=5][SIZE=4]My beta testers - beta testing[\/SIZE][\/SIZE]\n[SIZE=5][SIZE=4]Me - The other 99.9% :p[\/SIZE][\/SIZE]\n\n[SIZE=5][SIZE=4][HR][\/HR][\/SIZE][\/SIZE]\n[B][SIZE=5]Notes:\n[\/SIZE][\/B]\n[SIZE=4]The lack of customization is intentional. These cars operate under a very restrictive ruleset IRL, and I wanted to replicate that. This mod aims to achieve ultimate realism and a sim-like experience for anyone interested in sim racing. It's therefore aimed at people that do online races and\/or competitive time trials, or those that just want to squeeze every millisecond out of a setup.\n\nIf you want customization and endless levels of crazyness, please do consider downloading other mods from this community's awesome modders, or download add-ons for the F4, as I will not be adding \"unrealistic\" parts to this mod. Bombing the reviews section with 1-star reviews that basically say \"bad because it has no customization\" has no use, so please avoid doing so.\n\nIt's absolutely fine if you prefer fun experiences to serious sim racing ones. But please understand that this mod is not meant for that.\n[\/SIZE]\n[B][SIZE=5]Have fun! :D[\/SIZE][\/B]",
